			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Standardize FileExplorerViewProvider import to PascalCase\n\nReplace the direct module import of `FileExplorerViewProvider` with an explicit type alias to the `Struct` variant (`FileSystem::FileExplorerViewProvider::Struct as FileExplorerViewProvider`).\n\nThis aligns the bootstrap command imports with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention for types, mirroring recent refactorings in workspace and cache modules where logical units are exposed as `Struct` or `Fn` variants. The change ensures the type name used in the module path strictly follows the convention without ambiguity between the module namespace and the struct definition.\n\nNo runtime behavior or logic is altered; this is purely a style and consistency update to the import statements in `Source/Command/Bootstrap.rs`.",
			"SHA": "3f7b2c96173ed8bf734d107dfd28ce7d823a693d"
